#
# Cluster shape: two gateways in one group.
#
# For anything whose behaviour only exists with more than one gateway: load
# balancing group ownership and `namespace change_load_balancing_group`,
# per-gateway listeners, `gateway listener_info`, and the monitor-side
# `ceph nvme-gw` membership and HA commands.
#
# shellcheck shell=bash

GATEWAYS=2
